      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصْرَاحٌ</span></b>  A she-camel <i>that does not yield frothy
milk;</i> (T, K; [in the CK, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لا تَرْعَى</span> is put for
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لا تُرَغِّى</span>;]) <i>that yields pure milk, with little froth.</i>
(M, TA.)

